        "original_id": "577305e3-54ac-5c6a-b811-73f4b69e7117",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince, Spike Lee\n- Products: Emancipation, Chaos and Disorder, Girl 6 soundtrack\n- Companies: 40 Acres and a Mule Filmworks\n- Topics: 1996 Prince releases, film production\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Spike Lee's production company 40 Acres and a Mule Filmworks began producing films.\n- Since 1983, 40 Acres and a Mule Filmworks has produced over 35 films.\n- In 1996, Prince released Emancipation as his third album of that year.\n- In 1996, Prince also released Chaos and Disorder and the soundtrack album for Spike Lee's film Girl 6.\n- Prince's three album releases in 1996 made that year one of his most prolific years for released material.",
